      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}\n\nI see what you are trying to achieve with it, but I think you might need to work on the presentation a bit at the very least.\n\nThe way it is presented right now is indistinguishablefrom a lootbox system, which is making a lot of people very uncomfortable.",
