  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-11T18:12:21.760Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new \"Bundles and packs\" feature is not cool.\n\nI don't really care if they are meant to be a path towards real money gambling for VRChat or not, it is close enough of a feature that I will be super uncomfortable with even talking about the game to my friends.\n\nI am a long time vrc+ subscriber because I love this game and community, but anything even resebling lootboxes are unethical and not cool. this kind of gambling only targets people who struggle with it, not the people who can afford it.",
